{"url": "https://www.sapekhaticollege.com/", "retrieved": "2026-10-02", "status": "ok", "final_url": "https://www.sapekhaticollege.com/", "text": "SAPEKHATI COLLEGE\nSAPEKHATI COLLEGE\nসাপেখাতী মহাবিদ্যালয়\nAffiliated to Dibrugarh University\nAccredited by NAAC with Grade B\nHome\nAbout Us\nAbout the College\nMission & Vision\nFacilities\nContact\nGallery\nAdministration\nPrincipal Desk\nGoverning Body\nRules & Regulations\nStaff Login\nCurriculum\nCells & Committees\nICC\nGrievances & Redressal Cell\nOBC Cell\nST/SC Cell\nAnti-Ragging Committee\nAlumni Association\nDepartments\nAssamese\nEconomics\nEducation\nEnglish\nHistory\nPolitical Science\nSociology\nStaff\nTeaching\nNon-Teaching\nLibrary\nAcademics\nAdmission\nCourses\nDownloads\nTime Tables\nSyllabus\nAcademic Calendar\nHoliday List\nResults\nForms\nProspectus\nNewsletter\nIQAC\nIQAC Home\nIQAC Composition\nMinutes of IQAC\nBest Practices\nAQAR\nOther Documents\nDVV\nCertificate of Accreditation\nPolicies and Plans\nOthers\nRTI\nNSS\nFeedback\nNotification\nNotice\nEvents\nResults\nTenders\nABOUT US\nThe Sapekhati College was established on 11th August, 1988 by the decision of a few devoted people of Sapekhati \n\t\t\t   and its surrounding areas .The college is located in a rural area in Charaideo District of Assam. Since its \n\t\t\t   establishment the institution has been serving sincerely to spread educations to surrounding areas. The college \n\t\t\t   provides educational upliftment to a large section of  students coming from the Tea-Tribes, SC- ST, OBC, and \n\t\t\t   the other neighboring states like Arunachal Pradesh and Nagaland.\n\t\t\t\tThe college has a campus spread over 3.0059 acres of land with adequate infrastructure facilities. The college\n\t\t\t\toffers B.A. in three year degree course (CBCS) which is divided by six semesters through the subjects . . .\nRead more\nNOTIFICATIONS\nNotice\n13-08-26\nForm Fill up notice for B.A. 1st / 3rd/ 5th Semester (CBCS) Backlog Examination 2026\nNoti